                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "et_pb_text_1",
                  "html": "<p>Here at Blaco Hill Cottages we aim to provide a relaxing and care-free environment that offers cosy cottages sympathetically restored with everything you need for a stay away from home. We welcome all people to stay at Blaco for whatever the reason you are travelling to this beautiful and peaceful part of the country , be it friends or families gathering, or if you are working in the area we can help.</p>",
                  "sansHeadings": {},
                  "hiddenOn": []
                }
              ]
            }
