                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "et_pb_text_2",
                  "html": "<h3> Swift - Sleeps 6</h3> <p>A large 3 bedroomed cottage on one floor, with kitchen-diner and large family lounge. Master bedroom with ensuite. One family bathroom with corner bath &amp; shower. Private patio through French doors from lounge.</p>",
