                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "et_pb_text_3",
                  "html": "<h3>Partridge - Sleeps 6</h3> <p><span>The perfect place for a family looking for a quiet rural escape on a working farm. Step into the open-plan living room, with four-seater sofa and two tub chairs, a Smart TV and dining area, all overlooking the lovely green spaces around the farm buildings.</span></p>",
                  "sansHeadings": {
                    "h3": "700"
