                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "et_pb_text_4",
                  "html": "<h3> Chaffinch - Sleeps 4</h3> <p>This two storey cottage offers cosy open plan family living downstairs, with large porch area. Upstairs you will find a master and twin with characterful beams and high ceilings both ensuite.</p>",
